  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Cybersecurity and Data Protection Solutions, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) will familiarize public and/or private sector representatives from South Africa with the latest U.S. technologies, services, and best practices in cybersecurity and data protection solutions. The RTM will include meetings with U.S. industry representatives, associations, financial institutions, and U.S. government agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
